<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, Christ is my strength, salvation and song!</l><l>Of Him I must sing, and sing all day long!</l><l>The God-man who came, yes, Jesus His name—</l><l>Today, yesterday, forever the same!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>This One is my peace, my healing, my rest,</l><l>My light in the night, my joy in distress;</l><l>My Shepherd who guides to rivers of life</l><l>Brings joy to my heart and blissful delight!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>My Christ is true joy, my sunlight each day,</l><l>When I sing of Him no sorrow can stay!</l><l>My death He made life, my mourning made song,</l><l>Of Him I must sing and sing all day long!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
